00:04:04.270 --> 00:04:05.760
I'm counting on you.

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:22.500
Sorry I'm late.

00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:23.660
Don't worry about it.

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:28.000
Oh, that's right... How's your knee?

00:04:29.380 --> 00:04:31.630
You tripped on your way out of the house, didn't you?

00:04:32.180 --> 00:04:34.500
Huh? How do you know that?

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:37.600
I know everything about you, Yuudai-kun.

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:40.230
Wow, incredible.

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:43.600
She's such a mysterious girl.

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:44.970
Chizuru-chan.

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:47.730
Your outfit really suits you today.

00:04:47.730 --> 00:04:48.430
You think so?

00:04:49.230 --> 00:04:50.240
Thanks.

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:53.400
Should I be saying things like that?

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:55.350
I've got to let her know today!

00:04:55.910 --> 00:04:57.950
You're pretty stylish yourself, Yuudai-kun.

00:04:57.950 --> 00:04:58.950
You look good.

00:04:58.950 --> 00:04:59.790
Yeah, I guess.

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:01.270
I thought so, too.

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.610
That's enough. The present!

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:04.920
Oh yeah.

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:06.960
This is for you.

00:05:07.960 --> 00:05:08.920
Thank you!

00:05:11.050 --> 00:05:11.840
Sorry.

00:05:14.970 --> 00:05:16.290
Hello?

00:05:17.640 --> 00:05:18.390
Hello?

00:05:18.390 --> 00:05:19.930
My connection is lousy...

00:05:22.260 --> 00:05:23.850
Hello?

00:05:23.850 --> 00:05:27.480
This is Oohashi from Hamel Pet Shop.

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:28.220
Oh, hello.

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:31.070
There's been a bit of a mix-up.

00:05:31.070 --> 00:05:32.140
What? A mix-up?

00:05:32.690 --> 00:05:35.240
Have you opened the box yet?.

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:36.950
No, not yet.

00:05:37.530 --> 00:05:38.650
Well, you see,

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:42.860
the rabbit you purchased is still here.

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:45.750
What? What do you mean?

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:50.240
We think that a miniature donkey might have climbed into the box instead.

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:53.420
Excuse me? A miniature donkey?

00:05:53.420 --> 00:05:55.550
It climbed in instead?

00:05:55.550 --> 00:05:58.330
Do animals really do that sort of thing?

00:05:58.890 --> 00:06:00.850
A mini-donkey would.

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:05.300
We can swap them right away.
Do you think you could swing by?

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:08.900
Understood. I'll bring it there as soon as I can.

00:06:08.900 --> 00:06:12.510
Also, please be sure not to open the box!

00:06:13.070 --> 00:06:17.030
Mini-donkeys are feisty little creatures.

00:06:17.660 --> 00:06:18.740
Understood.

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:21.740
What the heck? A mini-donkey?

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:40.390
Hello!

00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:42.470
Hello.

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:45.520
Huh? Who's this?

00:06:46.140 --> 00:06:48.130
Someone must have dropped this phone.

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:49.520
Where are you?

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:50.980
Where?

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:53.440
I think it's Higashi-machi 3-chome.

00:06:53.440 --> 00:06:56.320
Please take good care of it. I'll call you in just a minute.

00:06:56.320 --> 00:06:57.110
Sure.

00:07:18.420 --> 00:07:20.750
Also, please be sure not to open the box!

