00:07:56.840 --> 00:07:57.840
Yuudai-kun!

00:07:59.420 --> 00:08:01.540
Chizuru-chan, I was looking for you!

00:08:06.640 --> 00:08:07.630
What's wrong?

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:16.400
Run!

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:34.960
Hey...

00:08:38.170 --> 00:08:40.670
Buddy, why don't you make this up to me?

00:08:47.260 --> 00:08:48.470
Wash these, too.

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:54.090
I don't have time for this.

00:09:00.280 --> 00:09:01.940
She might have gone home.

00:09:09.290 --> 00:09:10.540
Grandma...

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:13.210
Thank you.

00:09:14.210 --> 00:09:15.040
Don't mention it.

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:18.500
I'm sorry, Chizuru-chan.

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:27.420
She's cute.

00:09:33.380 --> 00:09:35.100
Hello!

00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:37.090
Yeah, I found your cell phone.

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:39.150
This is the voicemail center.

00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:43.490
No, it's okay, I know how devastating it can be.

00:09:43.490 --> 00:09:47.490
Well, I don't know what time I'm getting off work.

00:09:47.490 --> 00:09:50.580
In any case, I'll bring it over to your house.

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:51.730
It's no big deal, I'm in a car.

00:10:08.470 --> 00:10:10.430
Good, the lights are on.

00:10:12.720 --> 00:10:14.270
I'm not sure what to do about him.

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:18.690
He's indecisive and a real coward.

00:10:18.690 --> 00:10:20.140
Plus he's not very bright.

00:10:20.770 --> 00:10:23.100
You're much more dependable.

00:10:24.490 --> 00:10:27.350
In any case, he doesn't get me at all.

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:32.190
Stop that!

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:34.620
Stop, it tickles!

00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:57.020
Up next is Shin-Miyanosaka, Shin-Miyanosaka.

00:11:21.920 --> 00:11:23.240
Yoohoo!

00:11:24.050 --> 00:11:26.830
Miki-chan... What's up?

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:31.220
Well, you see, I got into a fight with my
boyfriend and I don't have anywhere to go.

00:11:31.760 --> 00:11:32.760
And?

00:11:32.760 --> 00:11:34.170
And...

00:11:34.850 --> 00:11:36.470
Thanks for having me!

00:11:37.060 --> 00:11:39.460
H-Hey!

00:11:41.810 --> 00:11:45.780
Umm, I'm actually seeing someone right now...

00:11:45.780 --> 00:11:48.140
Well, I'm not really sure if we are, but...

00:11:48.650 --> 00:11:52.870
In any case, you and I are... I mean, err...

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:55.870
What are you babbling about?

00:12:00.370 --> 00:12:02.860
I'm not gonna hit you in the middle of the night or anything, so relax.

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:05.090
That's not the problem.

00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:08.450
I guess it is a problem.

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:09.880
By the way,

00:12:09.880 --> 00:12:12.460
why did we break up again?

00:12:13.340 --> 00:12:16.460
Now that I think about it, were we even dating?

00:12:29.900 --> 00:12:32.110
Someone said it to me again.

00:12:38.580 --> 00:12:40.230
I'll have the mackerel miso pasta.

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:43.080
I'll have the paella, actually...

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:45.990
The pilaf... Umm, can you give me a minute?

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:48.170
I'll wait until you've decided.

00:12:50.210 --> 00:12:51.220
Sorry.

00:12:51.220 --> 00:12:53.840
No, you should take your time.

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:57.390
Hey, this one sounds good!

00:13:03.060 --> 00:13:06.610
"Yuudai-kun, I'm sorry I vanished like that today."

00:13:07.150 --> 00:13:09.860
"Let's try and do it again tomorrow."

00:13:09.860 --> 00:13:11.530
"It's late, so I'm just sending a text message."

00:13:12.280 --> 00:13:14.490
"Oh, oh, it's snowing outside!"

00:13:14.490 --> 00:13:15.450
"Good night."

00:13:15.450 --> 00:13:16.370
"–Chizuru."

00:13:17.870 --> 00:13:20.160
Maybe she had a friend over earlier.

00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:24.820
Yeah. Yeah, that's it!

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:32.830
Ken-chan...

00:13:33.510 --> 00:13:35.250
I'm sorry.

00:13:48.610 --> 00:13:51.150
I'm going to be leaving now, so...

00:13:51.150 --> 00:13:53.070
Have fun!

00:13:53.070 --> 00:13:55.100
No, not "Have fun!"

00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:59.240
But it's gonna take me a while to get ready.

00:13:59.240 --> 00:14:02.920
Fine then, just leave the key in my mailbox.

00:14:13.130 --> 00:14:14.260
Chizuru-chan!

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:16.010
What's wrong?

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:17.970
What is it?

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:21.220
Sorry! Go over there.

00:14:25.020 --> 00:14:26.310
Chizuru-chan!

00:14:26.310 --> 00:14:27.730
Good morning.

00:14:27.730 --> 00:14:29.050
Sorry about yesterday.

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:31.900
Yeah, I was worried.

00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:34.360
I dropped my phone and couldn't contact you.

00:14:34.360 --> 00:14:35.610
Oh yeah!

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:38.910
There was a miniature donkey in that box, right?

00:14:38.910 --> 00:14:40.030
Yeah, there was!

00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:41.520
I see.

00:14:43.700 --> 00:14:48.240
It was a mix-up... It didn't bite you, did it?

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:50.200
I'm fine.

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:51.990
Great.

00:14:54.300 --> 00:14:55.740
Is something the matter?

00:14:56.760 --> 00:14:58.470
Who is she?

00:15:00.510 --> 00:15:02.180
I'm Miki!

00:15:02.180 --> 00:15:05.840
Well, you see, she's...

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:08.210
What's the meaning of this?

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:12.180
What's... the meaning of this?

00:15:13.860 --> 00:15:17.640
Weren't you with a man last night?

00:15:18.150 --> 00:15:19.270
Was I?

00:15:20.240 --> 00:15:24.060
And you two were making fun of me, right?

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:26.270
It was a man, wasn't it?

00:15:29.790 --> 00:15:30.740
It was.

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:33.920
See you.

00:15:35.840 --> 00:15:36.700
See ya!

00:15:48.350 --> 00:15:51.050
I made up with my boyfriend, so I'm gonna take off now.

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:53.930
He said, "You're the only one for me. Come home!"

00:15:55.360 --> 00:15:55.970
See ya!

00:15:57.030 --> 00:15:59.110
Oh, what's that box?

00:15:59.110 --> 00:16:01.530
A present from your girlfriend?

00:16:01.530 --> 00:16:03.270
Not bad!

00:16:10.540 --> 00:16:11.610
Don't tell me...

00:16:13.040 --> 00:16:14.110
The mini-donkey...

00:16:39.110 --> 00:16:39.810
Mini-donkey?!

00:16:47.280 --> 00:16:48.450
It's asleep.

00:16:54.380 --> 00:16:56.540
"I need to apologize to you."

00:16:57.960 --> 00:17:02.000
"I lost the present I was going to give you yesterday."

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:06.420
"If it's okay, after I get off work, can we
continue from where we left off yesterday?"

00:17:07.010 --> 00:17:08.500
"Sorry."

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:11.230
"And please take care of the mini-donkey."

00:17:11.230 --> 00:17:13.850
"He's a lot of trouble, but he's not a bad guy."

00:17:13.850 --> 00:17:17.610
"He listened to everything I had to say last night."

00:17:17.610 --> 00:17:19.600
"Thank you for the lovely gift."

00:17:20.320 --> 00:17:23.730
So that's who she was talking to last night.

00:17:25.530 --> 00:17:27.440
I'm an idiot.

00:17:30.330 --> 00:17:33.230
It's your fault that Chizuru and I—

00:17:33.790 --> 00:17:36.880
Sorry. Never mind.

00:17:43.590 --> 00:17:45.540
I said those terrible things.

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:52.550
What are you looking at, Mini-donkey?

00:17:59.270 --> 00:18:00.270
Mini-donkey!

00:18:00.980 --> 00:18:02.140
Get back here!

00:18:02.900 --> 00:18:04.450
Where are you going?

00:18:25.010 --> 00:18:26.800
Why did he come here?

00:18:29.800 --> 00:18:31.500
Oh, man... Don't tell me...

00:18:32.220 --> 00:18:35.340
Come over here. You can't go up there!

00:18:38.230 --> 00:18:39.800
Mini-donkey!

00:18:40.480 --> 00:18:41.440
Hey!

00:18:42.610 --> 00:18:43.760
Hey!

00:18:46.070 --> 00:18:47.740
Where'd he go?

00:18:49.110 --> 00:18:50.270
I'm really high up!

00:18:53.120 --> 00:18:53.980
A balloon?

00:18:56.750 --> 00:18:58.280
Could that be...?

00:18:59.210 --> 00:19:00.320
Mini-donkey!

00:19:01.880 --> 00:19:03.370
What the heck is he doing?

00:19:09.720 --> 00:19:12.210
All right. Wait right there.

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:19.170
I can't believe this. This isn't funny.

00:19:33.490 --> 00:19:36.650
Ahead... Just look ahead.

00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:43.670
I-It's okay. Are you all right?

00:19:43.670 --> 00:19:46.160
Huh? What's in your mouth?

00:19:48.130 --> 00:19:49.000
Yuudai-kun!

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:56.460
Chizuru-chan? Why?

00:19:56.460 --> 00:19:58.260
Be careful, it's dangerous!

00:20:00.230 --> 00:20:04.590
I have... something to tell you.

00:20:06.730 --> 00:20:11.060
It's fine. I can do this.

00:20:11.530 --> 00:20:12.810
I can definitely do this.

00:20:22.880 --> 00:20:25.170
You can make it! Just a little farther!

00:20:26.380 --> 00:20:28.160
That's dangerous!

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:29.660
Just stay there!

00:20:30.690 --> 00:20:32.000
Yuudai-kun...

00:20:35.300 --> 00:20:36.350
Chizuru!

00:20:42.100 --> 00:20:43.190
Yuudai-kun!

00:20:45.770 --> 00:20:48.860
Yuudai-kun! Yuudai-kun!

00:20:48.860 --> 00:20:51.270
Hey! Are you two okay?!

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:24.130
Thank heavens, you woke up.

00:21:25.600 --> 00:21:27.050
I'm so glad she's safe.

00:21:29.020 --> 00:21:31.570
That's right. Tell her.

00:21:31.570 --> 00:21:32.680
Tell her how you feel.

00:21:34.910 --> 00:21:37.120
Huh? Chizuru-chan?

00:21:37.780 --> 00:21:40.980
The girl went down already, if that's who you mean.

00:21:42.290 --> 00:21:43.250
Why?

00:21:43.250 --> 00:21:44.490
I don't know.

00:21:53.340 --> 00:21:54.800
This is the voicemail center.

00:22:17.590 --> 00:22:18.310
What's this?

00:22:20.950 --> 00:22:23.280
Is this what the mini-donkey had in its mouth?

00:22:27.170 --> 00:22:28.330
"To: Yuudai-kun,"

00:22:29.130 --> 00:22:30.160
"I love you."

00:22:31.250 --> 00:22:32.550
"Thank you."

00:22:32.550 --> 00:22:33.790
"–Chizuru."

00:22:35.800 --> 00:22:37.910
Chizuru, I love you.

00:22:37.910 --> 00:22:40.750
Right now and in the future. From this moment forth!

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.040
tsumazuite korondetara oitekarenda

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.040
I tripped, fell and was left behind.

00:23:03.720 --> 00:23:10.660
doromizu no naka o kyou mo yoromekinagara susumu

00:23:03.720 --> 00:23:10.660
So once again, today, I slop through the mud and move on.

00:23:11.310 --> 00:23:17.340
yogorechimatta boku no sekai uita hanashi nado nai

00:23:11.310 --> 00:23:17.340
I don't have much going on for me in my sullied world.

00:23:18.060 --> 00:23:24.320
shimitsuita kodoku ronri nuguenakunatteiru

00:23:18.060 --> 00:23:24.320
I can't even wipe away the loneliness that's taken me over.

00:23:24.570 --> 00:23:33.730
tamesaretemademo koko ni iru koto o kimeta noni

00:23:24.570 --> 00:23:33.730
Even though I'm the one who got myself in this mess,

00:23:34.170 --> 00:23:39.990
jumon no you ni shikata nai to tsubuyaiteita

00:23:34.170 --> 00:23:39.990
I keep muttering thew words "there's nothing I can do" like a spell.

00:23:39.990 --> 00:23:46.950
tsumiageta mono bukkowashite mi ni tsuketa mono topparete

00:23:39.990 --> 00:23:46.950
Smash all that's piled up on you! Take away everything you've put on!

00:23:47.170 --> 00:23:54.070
tomedo nai chi to ase de kawaita nou o uruose

00:23:47.170 --> 00:23:54.070
Refill the mind that you've emptied through your blood and sweat!

00:23:54.320 --> 00:24:01.210
ano koro no bokura wa kitto zenryoku de shounen datta

00:23:54.320 --> 00:24:01.210
There was a time when we were boys, giving it all we had.

00:24:01.420 --> 00:24:05.990
sekai o hiraku no wa dare da

00:24:01.420 --> 00:24:05.990
Who's going to be the one to unlock the world?

00:24:21.080 --> 00:24:27.300
asobu koto wasuretetara oitekarenda

00:24:21.080 --> 00:24:27.300
As soon as I forgot how to play I became an old man.

00:24:27.780 --> 00:24:34.110
kokontoko wa shigoto only waraenakunatteiru

00:24:27.780 --> 00:24:34.110
Now my life consists of nothing but work and I cannot smile anymore.

00:24:34.320 --> 00:24:43.400
garakuta no naka ni kagayaiteta mono ga ippai attarou

00:24:34.320 --> 00:24:43.400
But weren't there tons of dazzling gems within the trash?

00:24:43.730 --> 00:24:49.710
taisetsu na mono subete umoreteshimau mae ni

00:24:43.730 --> 00:24:49.710
So, before all that really matters to you is buried away...

00:24:49.710 --> 00:24:56.670
saegiru mono wa buttobashite matowaritsuku mono kawashite

00:24:49.710 --> 00:24:56.670
Banish away everything that's obstructing you! Shake off all that ties you down!

00:24:56.890 --> 00:25:03.990
tomedo nai chi to namida de kawaita shinzou uruose

00:24:56.890 --> 00:25:03.990
Refill the mind that you've emptied with your blood and sweat.

00:25:04.100 --> 00:25:11.010
ano koro no bokura wa kitto zenryoku de shounen datta

00:25:04.100 --> 00:25:11.010
There was a time when we were boys, giving it all we had.

00:25:11.010 --> 00:25:15.680
obietetara nanmo umarenai

00:25:11.010 --> 00:25:15.680
Nothing's going to happen if you live your life in fear!

00:25:29.860 --> 00:25:38.980
yodonda keshiki ni kotae o mitsukedasu no wa mou yame da

00:25:29.860 --> 00:25:38.980
Quit looking for answers in the same old places!

00:25:39.260 --> 00:25:46.980
nigotta mizu mo atarashii hikari de sugu ni sumiwatatteyuku

00:25:39.260 --> 00:25:46.980
Even muddy water will clear up with a new light!

00:25:46.980 --> 00:25:54.020
tsumiageta mono bukkowashite mi ni tsuketa mono topparete

00:25:46.980 --> 00:25:54.020
Smash all that's piled up on you! Take away everything you've put on!

00:25:54.200 --> 00:26:01.230
ikue ni kasanariau egaita yume e no houbutsusen

00:25:54.200 --> 00:26:01.230
A parabola to lead us to our collective dreams!

00:26:01.410 --> 00:26:08.300
magire mo naku bokura zutto zenryoku de shounen nanda

00:26:01.410 --> 00:26:08.300
We'll always be boys, giving it our all!

00:26:08.570 --> 00:26:13.310
sekai o hiraku no wa boku da

00:26:08.570 --> 00:26:13.310
I'm the one who's going to unlock the world!

00:26:16.430 --> 00:26:20.420
shikai wa mou sumikitteru

00:26:16.430 --> 00:26:20.420
I can already see it becoming clear to me.
